<main class="min-w-0 flex-1 p-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-16 pb-24 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-700">

        <header>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">About</p>
            <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">A visual editor<br>for Tailwind CSS</h1>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">Windcraft is a visual editor where every click writes real Tailwind HTML. Make the padding bigger and <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-900">p-4</code> becomes <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-900">p-6</code>. Edit the code and the design follows. There is no export step and no Windcraft-only format.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/editor/demo/index.html" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-black px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-neutral-800">Try the editor</a>
                <a href="/" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50">Browse the gallery</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">What is in it</h2>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5">
                    <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-gray-900"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M4 4l6 16 2.5-6.5L19 11z"/></svg></span>
                    <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Visual editor</p>
                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">Click anything and edit it. Every field is a Tailwind class, and the code is one click away.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5">
                    <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-gray-900"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></span>
                    <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Growing library</p>
                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">Tailwind components and pages as plain HTML. Copy one, or open it in the editor.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5">
                    <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-gray-900"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M7 7h10M7 7l3-3M7 7l3 3M17 17H7M17 17l-3-3M17 17l-3 3"/></svg></span>
                    <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-gray-900">Ways in and out</p>
                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">Figma plugin, MCP for Claude and Cursor, npm, and export to React, Vue or Svelte.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Projects and the gallery</h2>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-900 bg-black p-5 text-white"><p class="font-semibold">Projects</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-300">Private by default. Where your designs live, and the only thing AI and connected tools can read.</p></div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5"><p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Gallery</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600">Public. Look, like and copy. Save a copy into a project, or open it in the editor, to use it.</p></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Who it is for</h2>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-900"></span><span><strong class="text-gray-900">Developers and designers</strong> who want what they design to be the code they ship.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-900"></span><span><strong class="text-gray-900">Anyone building with AI</strong> who wants Claude or Cursor to start from their own designs, not from zero.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-900"></span><span><strong class="text-gray-900">Teams moving from Figma</strong> who want a design to become clean, editable Tailwind.</span></li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Principles</h2>
            <dl class="mt-5 divide-y divide-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white text-sm">
                <div class="grid gap-1 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><dt class="font-medium text-gray-900">It is just code</dt><dd>What you see in the editor is the HTML you ship. Export any time.</dd></div>
                <div class="grid gap-1 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><dt class="font-medium text-gray-900">Yours stays yours</dt><dd>Private designs are visible only to you. AI reads only your own projects, never the public gallery.</dd></div>
                <div class="grid gap-1 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><dt class="font-medium text-gray-900">Nothing is lost</dt><dd>Every edit keeps the previous version.</dd></div>
                <div class="grid gap-1 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><dt class="font-medium text-gray-900">Safe previews</dt><dd>Pasted code runs in a sandbox and can't reach your account.</dd></div>
                <div class="grid gap-1 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><dt class="font-medium text-gray-900">Bring your own AI</dt><dd>Use your Anthropic key or a local model. The Figma converter uses fixed rules and no LLM at all.</dd></div>
            </dl>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">What is next</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Plans, not promises.</p>
            <ol class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3"><strong class="text-gray-900">A better Figma converter.</strong> Constraints, lists, image crop and responsive output.</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3"><strong class="text-gray-900">Components and variants.</strong> Reusable pieces that are first-class in the editor.</li>
                <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3"><strong class="text-gray-900">A steadier drag.</strong> In more browsers and on large pages. Newer features are tested in Chrome only.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Who built it</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">Windcraft is built by <a class="font-medium text-gray-900 underline" href="https://www.swapniljadhav.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Swapnil Jadhav</a>. It runs on Node.js, Express, Handlebars, MongoDB and Tailwind CSS. The code, issues and pull requests are on <a class="font-medium text-gray-900 underline" href="https://github.com/Tolaj/windcraft" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/documentation" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-black px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-neutral-800">Read the documentation</a>
                <a href="/projects" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50">Open your projects</a>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</main>
